    description: "Green Tea is a glossy, variegated sage green that breaks over texture and can even shift to a glossy blue. Thicker coats build more crystal formation and color variation, while thin coats let the clay body show through. A 4 oz sample lets you test the variegation and crystal effect on your work before committing to a full pint.",
